(101, 'T-01012026-101', '2026-01-01 15:39:38', '2026-01-01 15:39:38', '36294544 | BNI | Transactions Verification', 2, '', '', '', 1034, 0, 0, 0, 5, 'tech.support@xoom.com', 20, NULL, '2-00034926346\nHello Team ,\n \nThrough our monitoring system we have detected that below transactions have not received an update.\n\nXQZK6ZJH\nX27PQVXG\nX94JHZRE\nXAWATXHG\nXFFX4JAK\nX73GCM7Q\nXQ7JT2XS\nXH673ZC3\nX3FG4WNW\nX36ASFJG\nX55NVQVF\nXT4FYQJP    \nX2H2SM9Z\n\n\nThe last code received for the oldest transaction was exception. The processing time SLA agreement requires that your system sends the next update in an instant and now all these have not received anything.\n\nPlease confirm ASAP what is causing the processing delay at your end as this is impacting our capability to honor the customer recipient dates available putting our business at risk with our regulators.\n\nWe expect a clarification as soon as possible to define our next steps to mitigate the impact.\n \n \nThank you,\nXoom Technical Customer Operations\n\nSecurity | Legal | Privacy | Privacy (USA) | About Us | Locations | Help Center', 'January 1, 2026\n2-00034926346\n\nGood Afternoon\nSir/Madam,\n\nThank you for trusting BNI and contacting us via email customer.inquiry@bni.co.id.\n\nI am Dwiky Alviansyah Putra and I will help you to explain all the information you need.\n\nRegarding your inquiry through email, we are pleased to help you.\n\nPlease be advised the status of your transactions as below :\n\nXQZK6ZJH PO is failed to processed due to NAME NOT MATCH, there is no debit on your account. Please check your account statement to make sure that your PO is not debited at your account before you take action. \nX27PQVXG PO is failed to processed due to NAME NOT MATCH, there is no debit on your account. Please check your account statement to make sure that your PO is not debited at your account before you take action. \nX94JHZRE PO is failed to processed due to NAME NOT MATCH, there is no debit on your account.