(205, 'T-02012026-205', '2026-01-02 11:41:09', NULL, 'FW: SMJ REQUEST: BNI STATEMENT ON DATE 31.12.2025-', 2, '', '', '', 1029, 0, 0, 0, 5, 'dijah@smjremit.com', 34, NULL, 'Dear Bni, \n\n\nPlease notice our email is an urgent request daily , due we are still unable to get bank statements from BNI portal. \nPlease assist our request by today for our daily reconciliation purpose ,We want request statement for IDR and USD on date 31.12.2025-01.01.2026\nYour kindness and cooperation is highly appreciated\n\n', '2 Januari 2025\n2-00034935660\n\n\n\nKepada Yth.\nRekan RVN\n\n\nTerima kasih atas kepercayaan Bapak/Ibu telah menjadi nasabah PT Bank Negara Indonesia (Persero) Tbk, dan telah menghubungi kami melalui layanan email customer.inquiry@bni.co.id\n\n\nPerkenalkan saya Fanka Amalia Ananda, Mohon bantuannya atas permintaan SOA tanggal 31 Desember - 01 Januari 2025 dari koresponden SMJ TERATAI SDN BHD (SMJTMYK1XXX) dibawah ini.\n\n\nSelalu waspada terhadap info kontak yang mengatasnamakan BNI di website umum. Untuk informasi dan pengaduan, pastikan hubungi BNI Call 1500046, website www.bni.co.id, WA BNI 0811-588-1946. BNI tidak pernah meminta data pribadi seperti OTP, PIN, CVC, User ID dan password e-Banking untuk alasan apapun.\n\n\nApabila ada hal lain yang ingin ditanyakan, Bapak/Ibu  bisa menghubungi kembali customer.inquiry@bni.co.id atau melalui :\nBNI Call Unit Trade Finance & Remittance 1500046 X (Twitter): @BNI\nInstagram: @bni46\nWhatsApp BNI: 0811-588-1946\nWebsite BNI: www.bni.co.id\nPetugas Customer Service di Kantor Cabang BNI terdekat pada jam kerja 08.00-15.00 waktu setempat\n\n\nDemikian kami sampaikan, atas perhatian Bapak/Ibu kami ucapkan terima kasih.\n\n\nHormat kami,\n\n\nFanka Amalia Ananda\nCustomer Experience Officer\nBNI Call - Unit Trade Finance & Remittance\nTelp: 021-29946099\n=========================OPEN', 225, NULL, 1, 117, NULL, NULL, 117, NULL),
(206, 'T-02012026-206', '2026-01-02 11:41:36', '2026-01-02 11:41:36', 'S10TBS13324825', 1, 'Iyum ', 'Solunto', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, '0754410632', 38, NULL, '2-00034938257, Iyum Solunto - Cek status OTR BNI Direct\n', 'Status ack tgl 30/12/2025 dan sampai saat ini tidak ada tolakan. Sarankan menghubungi layanan BNI Direct di nomor 021 (29946046) untuk bantu inquiry status ke bank koresponden. ', 41, NULL, 2, 121, 121, NULL, 121, NULL),
(207, 'T-02012026-207', '2026-01-02 11:43:59', NULL, 'BNI CANCELLATION :: CE# 803130558', 2, '', '', '', 835, 0, 0, 0, 5, 'cancellation.cs@alansari.ae', 20, NULL, 'Dear Team,\n\n \n\nWe kindly request your assistance to CANCEL, vide our test:                 10 - 3176                       dated   01-01-2026  for NA.\n\n \n\nREF# 803130558 ; DATED 30-DEC-2025  ; IDR 5364327.00  / IFO NUR ALFIN;;  CASH PICKUP ; BANK NEGARA INDONESIA\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\nThanks & Regards,\n\n \n\nMonique San Juan\n\nExecutive - Customer Service & Call Center, English\n\nOperations Department', 'January 2, 2026\n2-00034938450\n\n\nGood Afternoon\nMr. Monique San Juan,\n\n\nThank you for trusting BNI and contacting us via email customer.inquiry@bni.co.id.\n\n\nI am Fanka Amalia Ananda and I will help you to explain all the information you need.\n\n\nRegarding your inquiry through email, we are pleased to help you.\n\n\nPlease be advised that your cancellation request for PO ref 803130558 is under investigation at our related department. We will update you soon once we get the result.\n\n\nBe aware regarding contact information on behalf of BNI on public websites. For inquiries and complaints, please contact BNI at 1500046, visit our official website at www.bni.co.id, or reach us via WhatsApp at 0811-588-1946. BNI will never asks for personal information such as OTP, PIN, CVC, User ID, or e-Banking passwords for any reason.\n\n\nShould you have any further inquiries, please do not hesitate to contact us via email at customer.inquiry@bni.co.id or by phone to BNI Call Trade & Remittance Services at 1500046 / 021 29946099\nX (Twitter): @BNI\nInstagram: @bni46\nBNI WhatsApp: 0811-588-1946\nBNI Website: www.bni.co.id\nCustomer Service Officer at the nearest BNI Branch during working hours.\n\n\nWe would like to express our gratitude for your attention Mr. Monique San Juan.\n\n\nRegards,\n\n\nFanka Amalia Ananda\nCustomer Experience Officer\nBNI Call - Unit Trade Finance & Remittance\nTelp: 021-29946099\n======================OPEN', 95, NULL, 1, 117, NULL, NULL, 117, NULL),
