tomer.inquiry@bni.co.id or by phone to BNI Call Trade & Remittance Services at 1500046 / 021 29946099\nX (Twitter): @BNI\nInstagram: @bni46\nBNI WhatsApp: 0811-588-1946\nBNI Website: www.bni.co.id\nCustomer Service Officer at the nearest BNI Branch during working hours.\n\nWe would like to express our gratitude for your attention Mr. Aswin Babu.\n\nRegards,\n\nDwiky Alviansyah Putra \nCustomer Experience Officer\nBNI Call - Unit Trade Finance & Remittance\nTelp: 021-29946099', 93, NULL, 2, 116, 116, NULL, 116, NULL),
