(212, 'T-02012026-212', '2026-01-02 11:55:56', '2026-01-02 11:55:56', 'FW: Cancellation request - Fraud  | WACNY260022005', 2, '', '', '', 925, 0, 0, 0, 5, 'FI-Service.Indonesia@wellsfargo.com', 19, NULL, 'Good morning Mba Sondang/ Pak Ari and team,\nHappy New Year!\n \nKindly refer to SWIFT recall of funds below as the remitter claimed as suspected fraud payment.\nPlease provide the debit auth and return the funds, or provide an update via SWIFT reply.\n \nWe appreciate your assistance.\nThank you.\n\n\n \n\n\n:20:WACNY2600220055\n:21:2025103000512994\n:79: NARRATIVE\nUETR 40f9058d-57b0-4888-bceb-40cb0e681632\nATTN REMITTANCE DEPT. URGENT FRAUD CANCELLATION \nREQUEST REGARDING OUR PACS 008 FOR USD4,170.00\nVALUE 10/30/2025 UNDER OUR REF \n2025103000512994\nFAVOR OF NUR ALI\nPLS BE ADVISED THAT REMITTER HAS REQUESTED REFUND \nOF THE ABOVE MENTIONED FUNDS. REMITTER IS CLAIMING\nFRAUD \nPLS CANCEL OUR PAYMENT ORDER AND PROVIDE DEBIT \nAUTHORIZATION TO RETURN THE FUNDS. FOR ALL \nCOMMUNICATIONS PLS QUOTE OUR CASE NO \nWACNY2600220055.THANK YOU.\nREGARDS,\nMaureen Lopez, CUSTOMER CARE\n \n+++\n \nRegards,\n\n\nAdeline J. Amelia\nClient Service Officer, Senior Assistant Vice President\nGlobal Payments & Liquidity Service\n\nWells Fargo Bank | 138 Market Street #30-01 CapitaGreen, Singapore 048946\nMAC: O2304-300 I Mobile : +65 9889 3169 I Telephone : (+6221) 3950 1775 - (+6221) 3950 1776\nBusiness hours: 9 am – 6 pm Singapore Standard Time, Monday-Friday\n\n\nadeline.amelia@wellsfargo.com\n\nImportant note: Please contact us at FI-Service.Indonesia@wellsfargo.com for service-related inquiries', '02 Januari 2026\n\n\nKepada Yth.\nRekan ITF,\n\n\nTerima kasih atas kepercayaan Bapak/Ibu telah menjadi nasabah PT Bank Negara Indonesia (Persero) Tbk, dan telah menghubungi kami melalui layanan email customer.inquiry@bni.co.id\n\n\nPerkenalkan saya Fanka Amalia Ananda yang akan menjelaskan informasi yang Bapak/Ibu perlukan.\n\n\nBerkenaan dengan email yang Bapak/Ibu Rekan ITF sampaikan, dengan senang hati akan kami bantu.\n\n\ningin meneruskan permintaan dari koresponden Wells Fargo untuk membalas pertanyaan melalui MT199 dengan detail sebagai berikut:\n\n\nFormat Message\nPT. Bank Negara Indonesia (Persero) Tbk.\nDated : 01/02/2026\n\n\nMessage Type :199\nBasic Header :PNBPUS3NNYC\nReceiver :BNINIDJAXXX\nApplication Header :\n{1:F01BNINIDJAAXXX2871323814}{2:O1991936260101PNBPUS3NCNYC26617559812601020736N}{4:\n----------- Beginning of Text----------\nTransaction Reference Number\n:20: WACNY2600220055\nRelated Reference\n:21: 2025103000512994\nNarrative\n:79: NARRATIVE\nUETR 40F9058D-57B0-4888-BCEB-40CB0E681632\nATTN REMITTANCE DEPT. URGENT FRAUD CANCELLATION\nREQUEST REGARDING OUR PACS 008 FOR USD4,170.00\nVALUE 10/30/2025 UNDER OUR REF\n2025103000512994\nFAVOR OF NUR ALI\nPLS BE ADVISED THAT REMITTER HAS REQUESTED REFUND\nOF THE ABOVE MENTIONED FUNDS. REMITTER IS CLAIMING\nFRAUD\nPLS CANCEL OUR PAYMENT ORDER AND PROVIDE DEBIT\nAUTHORIZATION TO RETURN THE FUNDS. FOR ALL\nCOMMUNICATIONS PLS QUOTE OUR CASE NO\nWACNY2600220055.THANK YOU.\nREGARDS,\nMAUREEN LOPEZ, CUSTOMER CARE\n-}{5:{MAC:00000000}{CHK:DC8647065C3C}}\n----------- Ending Of Text ------------\n\n\nSelalu waspada terhadap info kontak yang mengatasnamakan BNI di website umum. Untuk informasi dan pengaduan, pastikan hubungi BNI Call 1500046, website www.bni.co.id, WA BNI 0811-588-1946. BNI tidak pernah meminta data pribadi seperti OTP, PIN, CVC, User ID dan password e-Banking untuk alasan apapun.\n\n\nApabila ada hal lain yang ingin ditanyakan, Bapak/Ibu bisa menghubungi kembali customer.inquiry@bni.co.id atau melalui :\nBNI Call Unit Trade Finance & Remittance 1500046 / 021 29946099\nTwitter: @BNI\nInstagram: @bni46\nWhatsApp BNI: 0811-588-1946\nWebsite BNI: www.bni.co.id\nPetugas Customer Service di Kantor Cabang BNI terdekat pada jam kerja 08.00-15.00 waktu setempat.\n\n\nDemikian kami sampaikan, atas perhatian Bapak/Ibu Rekan ITF kami ucapkan terima kasih.\n\n\nHormat kami,\n\n\nFanka Amalia Ananda\nCustomer Experience Officer\nBNI Call - Unit Trade Finance & Remittance\nTelp: 021-29946099\n==========================\nJanuary 2, 2026\n2-00034938572\n\n\nGood Afternoon\nMs. Adeline J. Amelia,\n\n\nThank you for trusting BNI and contacting us via email customer.inquiry@bni.co.id.\n\n\nI am Fanka Amalia Ananda and I will help you to explain all the information you need.\n\n\nRegarding your inquiry through email, we are pleased to help you.\n\n\nPlease be advised that your cancellation request has been forwarded to our related unit.\n\n\nBe aware regarding contact information on behalf of BNI on public websites. For inquiries and complaints, please contact BNI at 1500046, visit our official website at www.bni.co.id, or reach us via WhatsApp at 0811-588-1946. BNI will never asks for personal information such as OTP, PIN, CVC, User ID, or e-Banking passwords for any reason.\n\n\nShould you have any further inquiries, please do not hesitate to contact us via email at customer.inquiry@bni.co.id or by phone to BNI Call Trade & Remittance Services at 1500046 / 021 29946099\nX (Twitter): @BNI\nInstagram: @bni46\nBNI WhatsApp: 0811-588-1946\nBNI Website: www.bni.co.id\nCustomer Service Officer at the nearest BNI Branch during working hours.\n\n\nWe would like to express our gratitude for your attention Ms. Adeline J. Amelia.\n\n\nRegards,\n\n\nFanka Amalia Ananda\nCustomer Experience Officer\nBNI Call - Unit Trade Finance & Remittance\nTelp: 021-29946099\n\n', 82, NULL, 2, 117, 117, NULL, 117, NULL),
