bsite: www.bni.co.id\nCustomer Service Officer at the nearest BNI Branch during working hours.\n\nWe would like to express our gratitude for your attention Sir/Madam.\n\nRegards,\n\nDwiky Alviansyah Putra \nCustomer Experience Officer\nBNI Call - Unit Trade Finance & Remittance\nTelp: 021-29946099', 80, NULL, 2, 116, 116, NULL, 116, NULL),
